.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Editor and tool state. Neither belongs in a published library: Arduino
# Library Manager packages the whole repository, so anything tracked here is
# downloaded by every user who installs Hyperwisor-IOT.
#
# .vscode also carried machine-specific include paths, and .qoder/repowiki was
# 916 KB of generated API docs — a second, unmaintained description of this
# library that would drift from the README and contradict it.
.vscode/
.qoder/
